            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Mercifully, the opposing Myth energy of the Chain intermittently weakens him, but the Heart won't withstand such a beating for long.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Bartleby_EM2_28.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1448067,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "EM-HUSK-NPC01-A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Worse yet, Raven's Luphilim and all of Spider's Shadow sycophants have descended upon the Forest and are vying for the Heart as well.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Bartleby_EM2_29.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1448067,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "EM-HUSK-NPC03-A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "It's a supernatural free-for-all! Subduing a turbo-charged Titan won't be easy. This is going to take one formidable plan of attack.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Shadow_Bat_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Bat_EM2_37.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1448073,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "EM-HUSK-NPC01-A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "All it will take is for each one of you to realize your true purpose. And the backing of the Primordial Trees.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Tree_BartlebyProjection_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Bartleby_EM2_30.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1448067,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "EM-HUSK-NPC01-A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "They were my companions in the First World. They've remained frozen here, petrified by the horror of the First World's destruction.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Tree_BartlebyProjection_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Bartleby_EM2_31.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1448067,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "EM-HUSK-NPC01-A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "All trees keep within themselves a record of dramatic changes to their environment. You simply have to know how to access those records.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Tree_BartlebyProjection_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Bartleby_EM2_32.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1448067,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "EM-HUSK-NPC01-A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Each Grove of Primordial Trees heard a unique section of the Titanic Lullaby - the song that first put the Titans to sleep.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Tree_BartlebyProjection_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Bartleby_EM2_33.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1448067,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "EM-HUSK-NPC01-A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I'm still too weak to sing it by myself. That's why you must conduct the Primordial Trees in singing the Titanic Lullaby.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Tree_BartlebyProjection_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Bartleby_EM2_34.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1448067,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "EM-HUSK-NPC03-A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "How in the literal name of Creation are we going to do that?",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Shadow_Bat_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Bat_EM2_38.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1448073,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "EM-HUSK-NPC01-A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "My Scion possesses that which can awaken the Trees from their slumber: the Water from the Springs Eternal! As for the song, Mellori is the key.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Tree_BartlebyProjection_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Bartleby_EM2_35.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1448067,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "EM-HUSK-NPC02-A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Ugh! I thought we covered this already?! Sorry for the tone, Uncle B., but we gotta speed up the tempo here. Can you skip to the point, please?",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Human_Mellori_C_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Mellori_EM2_73.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1448072,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "EM-HUSK-NPC01-A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Haha. Your tone is precisly the point, Mellori. You know you are Raven's love for Spider. Well, that love set the tone for this world.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Tree_BartlebyProjection_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Bartleby_EM2_36.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1448067,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "EM-HUSK-NPC01-A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Don't you see, my dear girl? In the great Symphony of Existence, you are the <ITALICS>key</ITALICS> in which all divine melodies are played.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Tree_BartlebyProjection_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Bartleby_EM2_37.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1448067,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "EM-HUSK-NPC02-A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Oh. Well alright then.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Human_Mellori_C_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Mellori_EM2_74.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1448072,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "EM-HUSK-NPC01-A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "This rendition of the Lullaby won't be as powerful as the last, but it should calm the Storm Titan enough for you to remove him from the Chain.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Tree_BartlebyProjection_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Bartleby_EM2_38.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1448067,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "EM-HUSK-NPC02-A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Well then, I suppose we've got some destinies to fulfill. C'mon, Bat, let's stake out the first Astral Grove. Meet us there, Wizard!",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Human_Mellori_C_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Mellori_EM2_75.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1448072,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "EM-HUSK-NPC01-A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "My Scion, use the Eternal Water to revive the three Groves of Primordial Trees. And, of course, watch over Bat and Mellori.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Tree_BartlebyProjection_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Bartleby_EM2_39.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1448067,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
